      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so lately i've been having these weird moments where i just blank out. like i'll be talking and suddenly i can't find a super simple word or i just feel really confused for a few mins. idk if im just super stressed or if it's just like brain fog from not sleeping enough? it's kinda scary but maybe i'm just burnt out",
