    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i guess. it just seems like a lot of hassle to go to the doctor for something that goes away so fast. i've been reading online that sometimes these things are just nutritional defeciencies or even just being dehydrated. do u think i could just try taking some extra magnesium and vitamins for a week to see if it helps before i bother making an appointment?",
